  "notes": "ぱちぱち is a versatile onomatopoeia representing various light, sharp, repeated sounds or actions.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ぱちぱち{音|おと}を{立|た}てる: to make crackling sounds\n- ぱちぱち{拍手|はくしゅ}する: to clap hands\n- {目|め}をぱちぱちさせる: to blink repeatedly\n\nRELATED EXPRESSIONS:\n- {拍手喝采|はくしゅかっさい}: thunderous applause\n- {瞬|まばた}き: blinking",
